Northside (the gated RL + XGBoost hybrid) depends, at build/runtime
only, on separately-installed open-source packages — XGBoost (Apache
2.0), LightGBM (MIT), scikit-learn and NumPy (BSD), and treelite/TL2cgen
(Apache 2.0). None of those packages are redistributed in this
repository, so they impose no additional licensing constraint here.
